      "summaries": {
        "en": "Awesome Copilot is a community-curated collection of prompts, configurations, and techniques designed to maximize GitHub Copilot's effectiveness in code generation. It demonstrates how structured prompt engineering—like providing context, examples, and constraints—significantly improves AI-assisted coding accuracy and relevance. Developers can browse categorized examples to adapt proven patterns for their own workflows, experiment with different prompting strategies across languages, or contribute their own discoveries to help others write better code faster.",
        "zh": "Awesome Copilot 是一个社区驱动的资源库，汇集了优化 GitHub Copilot 使用的提示词、配置方案和实践技巧。它展示了如何通过精心设计的提示工程——例如提供上下文、示例和约束条件——来显著提升 AI 代码生成的准确性和实用性。开发者可以按类别浏览这些资源，学习如何为不同编程任务构造有效的提示，将其应用到日常编码中以探索更高效的协作模式，或贡献自己的经验来丰富这个不断成长的实用知识库。",
        "es": "Awesome Copilot is a community-curated collection of prompts, configurations, and techniques designed to maximize GitHub Copilot's effectiveness in code generation. It demonstrates how structured prompt engineering—like providing context, examples, and constraints—significantly improves AI-assisted coding accuracy and relevance. Developers can browse categorized examples to adapt proven patterns for their own workflows, experiment with different prompting strategies across languages, or contribute their own discoveries to help others write better code faster.",
        "sections": {
