          "what": "Awesome Copilot is a community-curated collection of prompts, configurations, and techniques designed to maximize GitHub Copilot's effectiveness in code generation. It demonstrates how structured prompt engineering—like providing context, examples, and constraints—significantly improves AI-assisted coding accuracy and relevance. Developers can browse categorized examples to adapt proven patterns for their own workflows, experiment with different prompting strategies across languages, or contribute their own discoveries to help others write better code faster.",
