      "summaries": {
        "en": "OpenProject is an open-source project management platform that helps teams organize work from planning to delivery in one integrated system. It stands out by combining traditional methodologies like Gantt charts with agile tools like Kanban boards, enabling hybrid workflows. Developers can deploy it on-premises for full data control or extend its Ruby-based architecture to create custom modules for specialized project needs.",
        "zh": "OpenProject是一款开源项目管理软件，它将项目规划、任务跟踪和团队协作整合到统一平台中，解决传统工具分散导致的效率问题。其技术亮点在于融合了甘特图等传统方法和看板等敏捷工具，支持混合工作流设计。用户可自主部署保障数据安全，也可基于Ruby架构扩展模块，适用于建筑工程、软件开发等多种需要定制化管理的复杂项目场景。",
        "es": "OpenProject is an open-source project management platform that helps teams organize work from planning to delivery in one integrated system. It stands out by combining traditional methodologies like Gantt charts with agile tools like Kanban boards, enabling hybrid workflows. Developers can deploy it on-premises for full data control or extend its Ruby-based architecture to create custom modules for specialized project needs.",
